WEBVTT

00:17:25.447 --> 00:17:31.046
spodobnost, delovna etika, ljubezen -

00:17:31.046 --> 00:17:35.370
in pustimo, da se sreča in
samozavest uredita sami.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.414
Mislim, da če bi vsi delali tako,

00:17:37.414 --> 00:17:40.955
bi bilo z otroki še vedno vse v redu,

00:17:40.955 --> 00:17:43.601
in enako z njihovimi starši,

00:17:43.601 --> 00:17:47.569
verjetno z obojimi celo veliko bolje.

00:17:47.569 --> 00:17:49.448
Hvala.

00:17:49.448 --> 00:17:53.448
(Aplavz)